  unitName: Aries of Enslavement (EU)
  unitId: 760176
  unitNumber: 7139
  description: "As he followed Jade one beautiful starry spring night along a path
    overgrown with lush verdure, Jason noticed that after he had stepped through
    a small dark puddle, time seemed to slow down. With each foot he set on the ground,
    he felt his feet getting increasingly heavy but, in contrast, his thoughts suddenly
    seemed to untangle, his mind almost physically seeming to extricate itself from
    thick treacle. He stopped, and stared after Jade\u2019s back as she walked away,
    unaware for the moment of the change that had taken place. And then he simply
    understood, and the charm was broken. He looked at his fists, which had long
    been the servants of the cruel praying mantis and consciously let anger and the
    Corruption invade him, washing away all enchantments. Jade, who was pregnant,
    didn\u2019t immediately notice he had gone. He was the first champion of the
    Corruption and was one of the few to have chosen it."
  summonDesc: The old me, the slave, is dead. The Corruption has set me free.
  fusionDesc: Let the Corruption free your minds.
